#!/usr/bin/env python3
#+
# Renders the TI5X Avalonia-Android launcher icons from the calculator
# illustration TI5X.Avalonia/docs/ti-59.svg (dark case, red LED display,
# gold 2nd key). Produces the same resource set as util/makeicons:
#
#   mipmap-{m,h,xh,xxh,xxxh}dpi/ic_launcher.png            (legacy square tile)
#   mipmap-{...}dpi/ic_launcher_round.png                  (legacy circle tile)
#   mipmap-{...}dpi/ic_launcher_foreground.png             (adaptive foreground)
#
# The tile keeps the makeicons design language: #181615 background with a
# #2B2B2B border (see Resources/values/colors.xml). The calculator content is
# inlined from ti-59.svg into a 100x100 wrapper (nested <image> references are
# not resolved by rsvg-convert), fitted by height and centred; the adaptive
# foreground keeps the content at 62% like util/makeicons.
#
# Requires rsvg-convert (librsvg, e.g. `brew install librsvg`).
#
#     util/makeicons-ti59
